{
  "name": "rtx5880",
  "description": "8x NVIDIA RTX 5880 Ada (48 GB each, sm_89) shared with other users: every cell takes the free GPUs it needs (auto_select_gpus). Cooling is stable, no clock drops: the cooldown gate is unnecessary, so back-to-back is the default protocol.",
  "gpu_name_pattern": "5880",
  "gpu_count": 8,
  "allowed_devices": [],
  "memory_gib": 48,
  "thermal_stable": true,
  "default_protocol": "back-to-back",
  "visible_devices": "0",
  "empty_gpu_max_memory_mib": 64,
  "loaded_gpu_max_memory_mib": 48500,
  "service_gate_continuous_s": 15,
  "cooldown_gates_frequency": false,
  "config_overlay": "rtx5880",
  "needs_overlay_for_tasks": [
    "qwen_t2s",
    "qwen_txt",
    "qwen_a2t"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The workstation is shared: all 8 GPUs may be used, but only free ones (no compute process, memory <= empty_gpu_max_memory_mib). Without --gpus each cell picks the lowest-index free GPUs, exactly `gpus_per_task` of them (default 1); --gpus pins an explicit list.",
    "M* BAGEL warm-up and graph capture used 47,638 MiB on GPU 4; the loaded-idle gate is set to 48,500 MiB, leaving about 640 MiB of device headroom.",
    "Tuned kernel configs are device-specific (device_name=...): every tuner must be re-run on this GPU (python -m exps.tuning status).",
    "Idle memory on a workstation card can exceed 17 MiB; run `python -m exps.hardware` and set empty_gpu_max_memory_mib from the idle value it prints.",
    "Qwen3-Omni 30B in BF16 is ~61 GB: the Thinker needs TP=2 over two cards; Talker + Code2Wav take a third (gpus_per_task=3, the fewest that run; the paper's 2xH200 topology also keeps Thinker and Talker apart). Overlays in exps/configs/hardware/rtx5880/.",
    "vLLM-Omni BAGEL two-stage loads the full 27.5 GiB LLM in the Thinker stage and needs its own card for the DiT stage (gpus_per_task bagel:vllm-omni-two-stage=2); single-stage, M* BAGEL, Cosmos3, Orpheus, Pi0.5 and V-JEPA run on one card."
  ],
  "auto_select_gpus": true,
  "qwen_thinker_tp": 2,
  "gpus_per_task": {
    "bagel:vllm-omni-two-stage": 2,
    "qwen_t2s": 3,
    "qwen_txt": 3,
    "qwen_a2t": 3,
    "bagel:vllm-omni-two-stage:cfg-parallel": 4
  },
